WEBVTT

00:28.170 --> 00:29.590
Kill 'em!

00:33.520 --> 00:36.010
Unhand me! How dare you treat me so!

00:36.610 --> 00:40.850
Do you think this affront to my personage 
will go without consequences?

00:40.850 --> 00:45.260
Someone! Cut down these men! Anyone!

00:51.040 --> 00:51.990
What is this?

00:54.640 --> 00:55.990
Come back!

00:56.270 --> 00:58.750
I cannot stay in such a dirty cell!

00:58.750 --> 00:59.700
Release me!

01:00.150 --> 01:02.480
I am telling you to release me!

01:04.090 --> 01:06.750
I-I am...

01:07.840 --> 01:11.960
I am the First Princess 
of the Tearmoon Empire,

01:12.690 --> 01:16.700
Mia Luna Tearmoon, Her Imperial Highness.

01:19.430 --> 01:22.390
Three Years Later

01:32.110 --> 01:33.780
Dinner is served.

01:34.800 --> 01:37.340
It always reeks in here.

01:37.340 --> 01:38.860
Makes me wanna hurl.

01:39.640 --> 01:40.710
Now, now.

01:40.710 --> 01:43.080
You know it's vegetables first.

01:47.030 --> 01:49.460
Oh, how wasteful.

01:49.800 --> 01:54.510
Ah, I seem to recall Her <i>Highness</i> had 
a distaste for Yellow Moon tomatoes.

01:55.130 --> 01:57.680
Well, this is your <i>last</i> meal.

01:58.060 --> 02:00.390
You can enjoy it as you see fit.

02:18.480 --> 02:19.190
Hey!

02:20.320 --> 02:21.980
You have a visitor before the end.

02:22.450 --> 02:23.120
Come.

02:46.700 --> 02:47.820
Get moving.

02:54.700 --> 02:55.980
<i>How...</i>

02:57.330 --> 03:00.200
<i>How did things come to this?</i>

03:04.250 --> 03:05.550
Do it already!

03:05.550 --> 03:07.160
You rotten wench!

03:11.390 --> 03:14.290
<i>How did things get so...</i>

03:17.580 --> 03:19.130
<i>How...</i>

03:21.750 --> 03:23.550
<i>How...</i>

03:47.490 --> 03:48.990
No!

03:52.080 --> 03:55.830
M-M-M-My neck! My neck! My neck!

03:56.720 --> 03:58.690
I-It's intact.

03:59.390 --> 04:01.690
My head is... still attached...

04:11.820 --> 04:14.180
I'm a...

04:15.970 --> 04:17.540
child?

04:31.440 --> 04:33.340
M-My goodness.

04:33.340 --> 04:35.970
I ought to know nothing 
like that could happen.

04:39.030 --> 04:40.850
What a silly dream.

04:40.850 --> 04:41.840
How childish of me.

04:41.840 --> 04:44.920
How could I ever think that was real...

04:46.640 --> 04:47.550
Oh?

04:53.910 --> 04:55.760
<i>My execution date draws near.</i>

04:55.760 --> 04:58.010
<i>I'm scared. So scared. I don't want to die.</i>

04:58.010 --> 04:59.490
<i>What did I do that was so wrong?</i>

04:59.490 --> 05:02.680
<i>Was it the "let them eat meat" thing?</i>

05:02.680 --> 05:05.740
<i>No, no, no, no, no, please. 
I don't want to die.</i>

05:05.740 --> 05:07.210
<i>I don't want to die—</i>

05:07.950 --> 05:11.950
No!

06:44.720 --> 06:47.270
I certainly feel less than my best.

06:48.380 --> 06:54.430
<b>Episode 1: The Princess Starting from the Chopping Block</b>

06:48.660 --> 06:52.340
These are the marvelously beautiful 
walls I have known my whole life.

06:52.630 --> 06:56.810
I am most certainly in a palace 
fit for the imperial family.

06:57.640 --> 07:01.520
All those frightful events I saw 
before must have been a dream.

07:02.240 --> 07:05.330
Letting myself be so disturbed 
by some nasty nightmare...

07:05.330 --> 07:07.280
How silly of me.

07:10.180 --> 07:13.690
Of course. A meal will make me feel better.

07:17.460 --> 07:20.710
F-Forgive me, Your Highness. 
Have I done something wrong?

07:22.080 --> 07:24.960
Princess Mia, Your Highness, 
is something the matter?

07:25.930 --> 07:27.420
<i>Wasn't he...</i>

07:27.950 --> 07:32.890
<i>I do believe this is the head chef I fired.</i>

07:33.290 --> 07:35.720
<i>I suppose it was two years from now...</i>

07:36.330 --> 07:40.550
<i>He would always serve vegetables 
I disliked, so one day I...</i>

07:40.550 --> 07:41.650
You're fired!

07:43.500 --> 07:45.690
Is there... some problem?

07:46.250 --> 07:49.140
No, all is well.

07:49.140 --> 07:52.930
In that case, allow me to serve 
your meal before it gets cold.

07:59.090 --> 08:00.150
Are these...

08:00.150 --> 08:02.830
I am fully aware you dislike 
them, Your Highness.

08:03.250 --> 08:05.380
But to ensure good nutritional balance, I—

08:05.380 --> 08:07.750
Oh, how I have missed this.

08:08.380 --> 08:09.010
Huh?

08:10.670 --> 08:13.960
<i>I can't handle the tart flavor 
of Yellow Moon tomatoes.</i>

08:14.930 --> 08:18.680
<i>But somehow these seem...</i>

08:25.100 --> 08:26.020
Chef!

08:26.520 --> 08:27.950
Y-Yes?

08:27.950 --> 08:30.490
Tell me, what is this dish?

08:30.980 --> 08:33.650
Yellow Moon tomato stew, Your Highness.

08:42.540 --> 08:43.980
Really?

08:44.620 --> 08:47.740
These... These are Yellow Moon tomatoes?

08:48.480 --> 08:51.260
The food I hated so much?

08:55.290 --> 08:56.750
<i>How delicious!</i>

08:59.630 --> 09:01.470
Y-Your Highness?

09:23.040 --> 09:27.260
Wh-Wh-Wh-What is the matter, Your Highness?

09:28.000 --> 09:29.210
Can bread...

09:30.350 --> 09:34.670
really be this soft?

09:35.490 --> 09:38.890
Is there some problem with my cooking?

09:39.410 --> 09:42.210
Not at all. I was moved.

09:42.690 --> 09:45.850
You prepared such a delicious meal for me.

09:47.600 --> 09:49.810
I appreciate the work you've done, chef.

09:50.030 --> 09:50.700
What?

09:51.860 --> 09:55.130
Our highly self-centered princess 
spoke words of appreciation!

09:55.130 --> 09:57.380
Do you think something 
might be wrong with her?

09:57.380 --> 09:59.780
You h-h-humble me!

10:00.410 --> 10:05.790
B-But today's stew merely made use 
of the flavor of the ingredients.

10:05.790 --> 10:07.870
I do not deserve any of the credit.

10:08.510 --> 10:09.830
You don't?

10:10.210 --> 10:15.460
For example, if you neglect to 
simmer Yellow Moon tomatoes,

10:15.460 --> 10:18.480
then they taste underripe 
and quite astringent.

10:18.480 --> 10:22.170
But if you simmer them for three days, 
then their naturally refreshing acidity

10:22.170 --> 10:26.060
and their hidden sweetness 
come to the forefront.

10:26.440 --> 10:30.310
Anyone can make it if they but 
take care with the amount of heat.

10:30.810 --> 10:32.800
Goodness. Three entire days?

10:32.800 --> 10:37.120
But if it takes so much time, 
you needn't go to such trouble.

10:37.120 --> 10:40.990
Ah, but Princess Mia,
 that would affect your health.

10:40.990 --> 10:47.700
Maintaining the royal family's
 good health is part of our duties.

10:51.250 --> 10:53.880
Of course, what I served today

10:53.880 --> 10:59.050
was a high-quality meal worth what 
commoners would earn in a month.

10:59.050 --> 11:01.840
So it may simply be an issue of cost.

11:02.130 --> 11:05.620
Oh? I don't have a sense of 
what a commoner would earn—

11:05.620 --> 11:09.810
Do you know how much is spent 
on the royal family's meals?

11:09.810 --> 11:10.510
Oh.

11:17.120 --> 11:18.100
Huh?

11:21.660 --> 11:26.710
Whose snide voice was it 
that I remembered hearing?

11:29.950 --> 11:32.860
When one needs to think, 
nothing beats sweets.

11:35.470 --> 11:39.220
You there, maid. Bring me something sweet.

11:39.220 --> 11:40.760
Yes, Your Highness.

11:48.260 --> 11:50.750
Ah, what a lovely fragrance.

11:54.310 --> 11:56.160
Wh-Why that's...

11:57.200 --> 11:59.190
c-c-cake!

11:59.190 --> 12:02.650
It has been far too long since I've had cake!

12:03.850 --> 12:05.490
Please forgive the wait, Y—

12:23.150 --> 12:24.340
Good gracious!

12:24.880 --> 12:26.800
Your Highness, I am terribly sorry.

12:27.070 --> 12:28.800
Are you unharmed?

12:28.800 --> 12:33.520
Y-Yes. I am quite all right. Thank you.

12:34.320 --> 12:37.640
Princess Mia hasn't snapped?

12:37.640 --> 12:39.980
No way! Does that mean 
we're due for a blizzard?

12:40.710 --> 12:42.190
More importantly,

12:42.190 --> 12:45.730
are you all right down there, Miss?

12:45.730 --> 12:50.490
The cake can simply be 
replaced with a new one.

12:50.490 --> 12:56.430
Your Highness, I am afraid that 
was the only cake available today.

12:58.670 --> 13:01.510
You, sit up!

13:02.910 --> 13:06.490
L-Look what you've done to my cake!

13:06.490 --> 13:08.430
She's back to her usual self.

13:08.790 --> 13:11.140
You, look up at me!

13:13.610 --> 13:18.480
I am t-t-terribly sorry, Your Highness.

13:24.420 --> 13:26.500
It's you...

13:34.470 --> 13:35.310
Hey!

13:36.600 --> 13:38.210
You have a visitor before the end.

13:38.680 --> 13:39.380
Come.

13:45.330 --> 13:48.800
Princess Mia, I've come to do your hair.

13:49.630 --> 13:50.890
Anne.

13:54.800 --> 14:00.690
Forgive me, Your Highness.
 I've never been very good with a comb.

14:01.600 --> 14:03.650
It doesn't hurt, does it?

14:07.740 --> 14:08.940
Why?

14:10.180 --> 14:14.790
Why are you still serving me?

14:17.040 --> 14:21.330
The others all stopped coming 
in less than a month.

14:21.930 --> 14:23.800
And yet you...

14:24.750 --> 14:29.760
have been visiting and taking care
 of me for three whole years.

14:31.540 --> 14:35.370
I have never done anything nice for you.

14:36.010 --> 14:37.930
In fact, quite the opposite...

14:39.210 --> 14:42.640
Yes. You hit me pretty often.

14:42.640 --> 14:44.360
And you kicked me, too, sometimes.

14:45.920 --> 14:51.090
You know something, Your Highness? 
Your kicks don't hurt at all.

14:52.290 --> 14:53.760
Do they not?

14:54.820 --> 14:59.380
Nope. Compared to the fights 
with my siblings, not one bit.

15:00.060 --> 15:03.710
I kept taking care of you 
like this, Your Highness,

15:03.710 --> 15:06.200
because I couldn't just leave you alone.

15:06.200 --> 15:08.300
There's no particular reason.

15:08.920 --> 15:11.130
That's it. It's time.

15:17.230 --> 15:18.520
Follow me.

15:23.800 --> 15:24.790
Pr—

15:36.080 --> 15:37.790
Hey! Stop!

15:44.440 --> 15:45.570
Your Highness!

15:46.460 --> 15:49.380
Please, lift up your head.

15:50.590 --> 15:55.600
In my current state, I am unable 
to reward your devotion.

15:56.580 --> 16:00.060
I can do nothing but say "thank you."

16:02.530 --> 16:04.690
Please forgive me.

16:11.710 --> 16:18.540
Princess Mia, I am praying for you 
to be granted heaven's protection.

16:34.580 --> 16:36.680
I remember.

16:40.150 --> 16:42.410
Your Highness, your dress 
will be soiled by cream—

16:42.410 --> 16:43.600
Silence!

16:44.850 --> 16:46.120
Miss Anne.

16:46.120 --> 16:49.440
I-I am truly sorry, Your Highness!

16:50.000 --> 16:52.190
I am not angry with you.

16:52.460 --> 16:54.680
Come. Do stand up.

16:54.680 --> 16:57.410
You are truly uninjured, I hope?

16:57.890 --> 17:02.120
Y-Yes. Thank you for your concern.

17:03.120 --> 17:08.080
This time I can reward your devotion.

17:08.720 --> 17:13.150
I hereby designate you to be my handmaid.

17:13.150 --> 17:16.300
You shall be charged with my personal care.

17:16.610 --> 17:17.350
What?

17:19.100 --> 17:22.790
I beg your pardon, Your Highness, 
but she is clumsy and careless.

17:22.790 --> 17:25.890
There is no telling what 
affronts she would cause you.

17:25.890 --> 17:28.250
And she is of common lineage.

17:28.250 --> 17:31.980
I rather think you two are causing 
the affront here, to Anne.

17:34.050 --> 17:37.230
Anne is now my handmaid.

17:37.230 --> 17:39.660
She is under my auspices.

17:39.660 --> 17:41.490
I suggest you both carefully consider

17:41.910 --> 17:44.500
the <i>full</i> weight of my words.

17:56.290 --> 18:00.300
<i>There's no denying it.
 Those memories were no dream.</i>

18:00.550 --> 18:06.430
<i>And this is unmistakably the diary 
I kept over the next eight years.</i>

18:06.730 --> 18:08.720
<i>Which means...</i>

18:13.730 --> 18:16.320
Um, Your Highness, are you all right?

18:16.320 --> 18:19.570
Y-Yes. I'm fine.

18:19.950 --> 18:23.550
But... if there is some way 
I might be of assistance...

18:23.550 --> 18:27.250
Oh, I see. If you insist...

18:27.470 --> 18:28.100
Yes?

18:28.780 --> 18:35.240
Um, well, although I did say I would assist,
 my help may not be all that—

18:36.240 --> 18:39.970
Might I have you use this to procure 
sweets the people might buy?

18:40.310 --> 18:42.430
Huh? Sweets?

18:44.300 --> 18:45.390
This is...

18:45.660 --> 18:48.860
Y-Your Highness! This is far too much!

18:48.860 --> 18:51.970
It would take a maid 
sixty days to earn this much!

18:51.970 --> 18:53.720
Oh. Is that so?

18:53.720 --> 18:56.640
But I only have certain money on hand...

18:56.640 --> 18:58.110
Oh, I know!

18:58.400 --> 19:02.950
Use the extra to buy something 
delicious for your family.

19:03.960 --> 19:05.100
And also...

19:06.150 --> 19:09.370
You are to address me as "Mia!"

19:09.690 --> 19:11.490
I, uh...

19:11.490 --> 19:14.590
I'll leave you to it. 
As quickly as possible, please.

19:15.040 --> 19:17.980
I will be in the Grand Library.

19:17.980 --> 19:20.620
Could you bring the sweets there?

19:21.820 --> 19:24.510
Snacks the people would eat. I cannot wait!

19:33.220 --> 19:37.610
<i>According to the memories I'm starting 
to recall from reading my diary,</i>

19:38.270 --> 19:42.700
<i>in just a few years, the finances of the 
Tearmoon Empire will deteriorate.</i>

19:42.700 --> 19:45.480
<i>And to make matters worse,
 a famine will spread.</i>

19:45.480 --> 19:47.620
<i>The populace will revolt,</i>

19:47.620 --> 19:50.830
<i>and neighboring nations intervene 
on the revolutionary army's behalf.</i>

19:51.160 --> 19:53.790
<i>I suppose that's about the sum of it.</i>

19:53.790 --> 19:58.640
<i>Regardless, at the time I had absolutely 
no interest in the outside world...</i>

19:58.640 --> 20:01.980
If they have no bread, 
then let them eat meat.

20:03.570 --> 20:06.480
Still, even knowing what will happen,

20:06.480 --> 20:11.770
I have absolutely no clue how to 
deal with politics and economics—

20:15.270 --> 20:17.770
<i>This is the story of a second chance.</i>

20:18.370 --> 20:21.380
<i>Having been reincarnated 
into her twelve-year-old self,</i>

20:21.380 --> 20:25.990
<i>and relying on her time-worn diary 
and her memories of the future,</i>

20:25.990 --> 20:28.160
<i>Mia will be sent scrambling hither and yon.</i>

20:29.220 --> 20:32.210
I refuse to give up.

20:32.210 --> 20:35.990
I'll do anything to avoid that 
fate at the guillotine!

22:07.130 --> 22:10.670
<i>In the Tearmoon Empire's capital, Lunatear,</i>

22:10.670 --> 22:15.100
<i>there are five Moon Ministries that 
assist in the ruling of the empire.</i>

22:15.100 --> 22:18.370
<i>The Azure Moon Ministry, charged 
with administration in the capital.</i>

22:18.370 --> 22:21.250
<i>The Crimson Moon Ministry, charged 
with governance of the provinces.</i>

22:21.810 --> 22:24.400
<i>The Verdant Moon Ministry, 
charged with foreign diplomacy.</i>

22:24.400 --> 22:27.820
<i>The Black Moon Ministry, charged with 
organizing the seven military branches.</i>

22:28.310 --> 22:31.280
<i>And the one Mia is currently visiting is</i>

22:31.550 --> 22:34.050
<i>the Gold Moon Ministry, 
charged with tax matters.</i>

22:34.780 --> 22:39.960
Um, Princess Mia, what business 
brings you here of all places?

22:40.390 --> 22:45.530
A man I wish to see—no, a 
man I <i>need</i> to see is here.

22:46.160 --> 22:50.680
<i>I had one other loyal retainer besides Anne.</i>

22:50.680 --> 22:53.240
<i>An outstanding young civil servant.</i>

22:53.240 --> 22:57.070
<i>He toiled tirelessly to 
rebalance the empire's finances,</i>

22:57.070 --> 23:00.690
<i>and by extension save the imperial family.</i>

23:01.470 --> 23:03.410
<i>A man who served to the end,</i>

23:03.410 --> 23:06.650
<i>never abandoning me, no matter 
the depths to which I sank.</i>

23:07.040 --> 23:13.160
<i>And yet his name is nowhere 
to be found in my diary.</i>

23:13.160 --> 23:15.120
<i>The only reference to him was...</i>

23:15.480 --> 23:19.330
<i>"The dour four-eyed nerd who 
was sent off to the provinces."</i>

23:21.280 --> 23:23.540
How can such wasteful spending be tolerated?

23:24.160 --> 23:26.250
I am sure I don't need to tell you

23:26.640 --> 23:30.930
that if things continue like this, the empire's
 finances will collapse before long!

23:31.920 --> 23:34.280
Bingo.

23:34.930 --> 23:39.930
Illustration by: Touco Shino
